@startuml
title RpcInvocation 的编解码与序列化

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "RpcInvocation" as Invocation
participant "ExchangeCodec" as ExchangeCodec
participant "DubboCodec" as DubboCodec
participant "Serialization" as Serialization
participant "Netty Channel" as Network
participant "DecodeableRpcInvocation" as DecodedInvocation
participant "Provider" as Provider
participant "DecodeableRpcResult" as DecodedResult

Invocation -> ExchangeCodec: encodeRequest(request)
ExchangeCodec -> Serialization: serialize(url, output)
ExchangeCodec -> DubboCodec: encodeRequestData(...)
DubboCodec -> Serialization: 写入版本、path、方法名、\n参数描述、参数值、attachments
ExchangeCodec -> ExchangeCodec: 写 16 字节头\n魔数 / 标志 / requestId / 长度
ExchangeCodec -> Network: header + body
Network -> DubboCodec: decodeBody(header, input)
DubboCodec -> DecodedInvocation: new DecodeableRpcInvocation(...)
DecodedInvocation -> Serialization: deserialize(...)
DecodedInvocation --> Provider: 恢复 Invocation

Provider --> DubboCodec: RpcResult
DubboCodec -> Serialization: 写结果标记、返回值或异常、attachments
DubboCodec -> Network: Response 字节
Network -> DubboCodec: decodeBody(...)
DubboCodec -> DecodedResult: new DecodeableRpcResult(...)
DecodedResult -> Serialization: 按结果标记反序列化
DecodedResult --> Invocation: RpcResult
@enduml
